{"id":"GRAM-FOCUS-001","category":"focus_particle_subject_clitic","status":"provisional","particle_family":["baa","ayaa"],"structure":"subject_before_focused_object_before_verb","subject_person":"third","subject_position":"before_focused_non_subject_np","clitic_requirement":"required","positive_example":"Wiilkii moos buu cunay.","negative_example":"Wiilkii moos baa cunay.","note":"When baa/ayaa marks a non-subject NP and the subject precedes that focused NP, a subject clitic is required.","source":"SLS resources/naxwe/09-weer-fudud.md"}
{"id":"GRAM-FOCUS-002","category":"focus_particle_subject_clitic","status":"provisional","particle_family":["baa","ayaa"],"structure":"focused_object_before_subject_before_verb","subject_person":"third","subject_position":"after_focused_non_subject_np_before_verb","clitic_requirement":"optional","positive_examples":["Moos buu wiilkii cunay.","Moos baa wiilkii cunay."],"note":"When the subject follows the focused non-subject NP but precedes the verb, repeating the subject clitic is optional.","source":"SLS resources/naxwe/09-weer-fudud.md"}
{"id":"GRAM-FOCUS-003","category":"focus_particle_subject_clitic","status":"provisional","particle_family":["baa","ayaa"],"structure":"focused_object_before_verb_before_subject","subject_person":"third","subject_position":"after_verb","clitic_requirement":"required","positive_example":"Moos buu cunay wiilkii.","negative_example":"Moos baa cunay wiilkii.","note":"When the subject follows the verb and baa/ayaa marks a non-subject NP, a subject clitic is required.","source":"SLS resources/naxwe/09-weer-fudud.md"}
{"id":"GRAM-FOCUS-004","category":"focus_particle_subject_clitic","status":"provisional","particle_family":["baa","ayaa"],"structure":"first_or_second_person_subject_with_focused_non_subject_np","subject_person":["first","second"],"subject_position":"any","clitic_requirement":"required","positive_example":"Adigu moos baad cuntay.","negative_example":"Adigu moos baa cuntay.","note":"For first- or second-person subjects, the subject clitic attached to baa/ayaa is required regardless of subject position in the structures described by the source.","source":"SLS resources/naxwe/09-weer-fudud.md"}
